Saspar
======

*"Time, unstoppable time … when will my time come to an end?"*

*A blindfolded gunman of the Order of Chaos who secretly longs to fail.*

**Background**

Saspar looks like a cold servant of the Order of Chaos, but
underneath he simply doesn't care whether he lives; he quietly
hopes to fail at his work and so be done with existence. His
magic comes from strange enchanted devices rather than study: a
gun that fires spells once loaded with the right bullet, and an
ornate pocket watch that lets him foresee events and head off
danger. He always wears a red sash over his eyes, and nobody
knows whether he's truly blind.

**Character Hooks**

The Order of Chaos makes Saspar and Acacia natural enemies for
anyone defending the world from evil -- Fukiko and Auren, whose
backgrounds both feature a vague darkness to be fought, fit
especially well. They can also serve as magical rivals.

